        "# cFish.io WordPress Development Toolset\r",
        "\r",
        "## Core Tools\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [Cursor](https://cursor.sh/) | Primary code editor | AI-powered code editor where you'll do most development |\r",
        "| [WordPress Studio](https://wordpress.com/studio) | Local WordPress environment | For testing and deploying to WordPress.com |\r",
        "| [Git](https://git-scm.com/) | Version control | Track changes and collaborate |\r",
        "| [GitHub](https://github.com/) | Code repository | Remote storage for your codebase |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Browser Testing Tools\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [Chrome DevTools](https://developers.google.com/web/tools/chrome-devtools) | Inspect and debug | Built into Chrome browser |\r",
        "| [Responsive Design Mode](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Tools/Responsive_Design_Mode) | Test responsive layouts | Available in most browsers |\r",
        "| [BrowserStack](https://www.browserstack.com/) | Cross-browser testing | Commercial service (if needed) |\r",
        "\r",
        "## WordPress Development Plugins\r",
        "\r",
        "| Plugin | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|--------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [Query Monitor](https://wordpress.org/plugins/query-monitor/) | Debug database queries | Essential for performance debugging |\r",
        "| [Debug Bar](https://wordpress.org/plugins/debug-bar/) | WordPress debugging | Shows query, cache, and other info |\r",
        "| [Theme Check](https://wordpress.org/plugins/theme-check/) | Theme standards validation | Ensures themes meet WP standards |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Performance Tools\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [GTmetrix](https://gtmetrix.com/) | Site performance analysis | Identifies optimization opportunities |\r",
        "| [WebPageTest](https://www.webpagetest.org/) | Advanced performance testing | Detailed performance metrics |\r",
        "| [Lighthouse](https://developers.google.com/web/tools/lighthouse) | Performance, accessibility, SEO | Built into Chrome DevTools |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Local Development Enhancers\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [WP-CLI](https://wp-cli.org/) | Command-line interface for WP | Automate WordPress tasks |\r",
        "| [Local Database Viewer](https://www.mysql.com/products/workbench/) | MySQL Workbench | Direct database manipulation |\r",
        "| [Visual Studio Code Extensions](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=wordpresstoolbox.wordpress-toolbox) | WordPress Toolbox | When using VS Code instead of Cursor |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Design & Asset Tools\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [Figma](https://www.figma.com/) | Design and mockups | Free tier available |\r",
        "| [Adobe Creative Cloud](https://www.adobe.com/creativecloud.html) | Image editing and creation | Commercial product |\r",
        "| [TinyPNG](https://tinypng.com/) | Image optimization | Compress images for web |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Documentation Tools\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [Markdown](https://www.markdownguide.org/) | Documentation format | Used in GitHub and documentation files |\r",
        "| [Docusaurus](https://docusaurus.io/) | Documentation site generator | If you need a dedicated docs site |\r",
        "| [Draw.io](https://app.diagrams.net/) | Diagram creation | Free flowchart and diagram tool |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Recommended Browser Extensions\r",
        "\r",
        "| Extension | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|-----------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [Web Developer](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/web-developer/bfbameneiokkgbdmiekhjnmfkcnldhhm) | Web development toolkit | Disable CSS, JS, and more |\r",
        "| [Wappalyzer](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/wappalyzer/gppongmhjkpfnbhagpmjfkannfbllamg) | Identify site technologies | See what a site is built with |\r",
        "| [Pesticide](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/pesticide-for-chrome/bblbgcheenepgnnajgfpiicnbbdmmooh) | CSS debugging | Outline all elements |\r",
        "| [ColorZilla](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/colorzilla/bhlhnicpbhignbdhedgjhgdocnmhomnp) | Color picker | Sample colors from webpages |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Deployment & Backup Tools\r",
        "\r",
        "| Tool | Purpose | Notes |\r",
        "|------|---------|-------|\r",
        "| [WordPress.com](https://wordpress.com/) | Hosting platform | Your production environment |\r",
        "| [UpdraftPlus](https://wordpress.org/plugins/updraftplus/) | Backup solution | If not using Jetpack backups |\r",
        "| [GitHub Actions](https://github.com/features/actions) | CI/CD automation | For advanced automated workflows | "
      ]
    }
